<section class="section wrap" id="estimate"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">{% if release.live %}Cleaning estimates · Calgary{% else %}Proposed prices · review preview{% endif %}</p><h2>A starting point.<br>For your space.</h2></div><p>An indicative range in CAD, before any applicable tax. Your written quote confirms scope, price and availability.</p></div><div class="estimate-layout"><form id="estimate-form" class="form-card"><div class="fields"><label class="field">Cleaning type<select name="service"><option value="regular">Regular cleaning</option><option value="deep">Deep cleaning</option><option value="moveout">Move-out cleaning</option></select></label><label class="field">Total area to clean<select name="band"><option value="0">Under 1,000 sq. ft.</option><option value="1">1,000–1,499 sq. ft.</option><option value="2">1,500–1,999 sq. ft.</option><option value="3">2,000–2,499 sq. ft.</option><option value="large">2,500+ / unsure</option></select></label><label class="field">Full bathrooms<select name="full"><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="many">5+ / unsure</option></select></label><label class="field">Half bathrooms<select name="half"><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="many">4+ / unsure</option></select></label><label class="field">Condition<select name="condition"><option value="typical">Typical for this service</option><option value="moderate">Extra buildup</option><option value="heavy">Heavy buildup / unusual work</option><option value="unsure">Unsure — review with me</option></select></label><label class="field">Basement area<select name="basement"><option value="none">No basement cleaning</option><option value="included">Included in total area above</option><option value="excluded">Not counted / unsure</option></select></label><div id="estimate-frequency"><label class="field">Frequency<select name="frequency"><option value="once">One-time</option><option value="weekly">Weekly</option><option value="biweekly">Bi-weekly</option><option value="monthly">Monthly</option></select></label></div><label class="field checkbox-line" id="estimate-established"><input name="established" type="checkbox"> This is an established maintenance schedule</label><div class="field full"><small>First visits use the full estimate. Ongoing estimate adjustments: weekly 10%, bi-weekly 5%; monthly uses the base rate. Applies to regular-clean base and bathrooms only, after scope review.</small></div><div class="field full"><span>Extras</span><div class="extras-grid"><label class="checkbox-line"><input name="oven" type="checkbox"> Inside oven · $40</label><label class="checkbox-line"><input name="fridge" type="checkbox"> Inside fridge · $35</label><label class="checkbox-line"><input name="cabinets" type="checkbox"> Empty kitchen cabinet interiors · $45</label><label class="checkbox-line"><input name="hair" type="checkbox"> Significant pet hair · $25</label></div><small>Move-out includes one oven, one fridge and empty kitchen cabinet interiors; no double charges. Deep and move-out include accessible baseboard detail.</small></div><label class="field full">Accessible interior window panes · $10 each<input type="number" name="windows" value="0" min="0" max="20" step="1"><small>Glass within safe reach; no exterior glass, screens or track restoration. More than 20 panes needs a quote.</small></label></div><noscript><p>Enable JavaScript to calculate, or email hello@elitecleanpro.ca for a quote.</p></noscript></form><aside class="form-card estimate-result"><p class="eyebrow">Your indicative estimate</p><div id="estimate-total" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><div id="estimate-lines"></div><p class="quiet">Before any applicable tax. This range is not a cap, a final quote or a reserved appointment. Condition, scope and cleaner availability are reviewed before confirmation.</p><a class="button" id="estimate-continue" href="/book/">Book your clean</a><p class="quiet">No account, address or payment details needed here.</p></aside></div><details class="scope-extras"><summary>What the estimate assumes</summary><p>The selected area includes all floors and basement areas to be cleaned. Each base includes one full bathroom, one kitchen, accessible surfaces and suitable floors. Full bathrooms have a bath or shower; half bathrooms have a toilet and sink. Bedrooms are not charged again because their area is included. Regular cleaning covers maintained surfaces; deep cleaning allows more detail; move-out assumes an empty home with utilities available. Ordinary products and equipment are assumed included, subject to the final quote. Parking or travel charges, if needed, are disclosed separately. Heavy buildup, specialist work, hazardous materials, wall washing and carpet extraction need review. No automatic rush or pet-ownership charge. The pet-hair allowance applies only when extra removal is requested.</p></details></section>